    turnFlow: 'The high bidder leads to the first trick. If a trump is led, players must play a trump if possible. If a non-trump is led, players must follow suit or trump if possible. Highest trump wins the trick; if no trumps, highest card of led suit wins. Winner leads to next trick.',
